{"unit_id":"Khellendros97__dsh-launch#card-zh","repo":"Khellendros97/dsh-launch","commit":"156626494d0afeace2f7c54e18f67704a22529a9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-launch 是面向 DSH Web 的服务管理插件，通过独立 broker 启动并监督长时间运行的开发服务器、watcher、mock API 等进程，让它们在会话结束或 DSH 重启后继续运行。插件提供启动、停止、重启、列举服务和查看日志的模型工具，并向其他插件提供 launch 服务；可选的 Service 侧边栏显示服务状态并提供控制操作。启动服务时可指定工作目录、环境变量和就绪条件，broker 会保存状态与日志并按策略重启异常退出的服务。适合需要在多个对话回合间保留本地开发服务的 DSH Web 用户。需要 Node.js 20 以上版本；不需要 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:400-450","lib/index.js:868-887","broker/broker.mjs:630-700","lib/client.js:390-420"]}
{"unit_id":"Khellendros97__dsh-launch#card-en","repo":"Khellendros97/dsh-launch","commit":"156626494d0afeace2f7c54e18f67704a22529a9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-launch keeps DSH Web services running beyond a conversation using a detached broker. Tools start, stop, restart, list services, and read logs; an optional sidebar shows status and controls. Configure working directories and readiness checks. Requires Node.js 20 or later; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:400-450","lib/index.js:868-887","broker/broker.mjs:630-700","lib/client.js:390-420"]}
