{"unit_id":"Khellendros97__dsh-launch#feature-1","repo":"Khellendros97/dsh-launch","commit":"156626494d0afeace2f7c54e18f67704a22529a9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-launch 的「持久化启动」功能：通过 service_start 启动长驻命令或应用，配置工作目录、环境变量及日志或端口就绪条件；进程由 detached broker 管理，可跨会话继续运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:400-490","broker/broker.mjs:630-700"]}
{"unit_id":"Khellendros97__dsh-launch#feature-2","repo":"Khellendros97/dsh-launch","commit":"156626494d0afeace2f7c54e18f67704a22529a9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-launch 的「服务控制」功能：模型可调用 service_stop 停止进程树，调用 service_restart 重新启动已记录的服务；服务列表会显示状态、进程号和退出信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:517-625"]}
{"unit_id":"Khellendros97__dsh-launch#feature-3","repo":"Khellendros97/dsh-launch","commit":"156626494d0afeace2f7c54e18f67704a22529a9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-launch 的「日志查看」功能：调用 service_logs 读取服务当前或先前运行的日志，可选择从开头读取或查看尾部，并限制返回行数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:642-695"]}
{"unit_id":"Khellendros97__dsh-launch#feature-4","repo":"Khellendros97/dsh-launch","commit":"156626494d0afeace2f7c54e18f67704a22529a9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-launch 的「Service 侧边栏」功能：在 better-sidebar 注册服务标签页，展示服务卡片、状态和日志，并提供启动、停止、重启及刷新操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:390-420","lib/index.js:896-930"]}
{"unit_id":"Khellendros97__dsh-launch#caveat-1","repo":"Khellendros97/dsh-launch","commit":"156626494d0afeace2f7c54e18f67704a22529a9","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-launch 的使用须知：服务会在本机以运行 DSH 的用户身份作为独立进程运行，并在用户目录保存状态和日志；停止插件不会自动停止服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["broker/broker.mjs:663-690","lib/index.js:868-890"]}
